          "h": "Quick Decision Tree",
          "body": "**Start here: What's your goal?**\n\n**I want to switch industries or work in consulting/finance/PM:**\n→ MBA (if 3+ yrs experience) or bootcamp/PM-specific program (if 0–3 yrs)\n\n**I want deep technical expertise and to stay hands-on (or pivot to PM/PM later):**\n→ MS in your chosen field (CS, Engineering, Finance, DS, etc.)\n\n**I want to manage people and lead organizations:**\n→ MBA (teaches leadership, strategy, org behavior)\n\n**I want to do a PhD later (research-focused):**\n→ MS as a stepping stone (most PhD programs prefer MS or research experience)\n\n**I'm <3 years into career and want to upskill:**\n→ MS (better network at this stage; save MBA for when you're senior)\n\n**I'm 3–7 years in and want to accelerate/switch:**\n→ MBA (if goal is business/leadership) or MS (if goal is technical)\n\n**I'm 7+ years in and senior:**\n→ EMBA (if you need a credential) or no degree (you're past the ROI window)\n\n**I'm visa-dependent and need sponsorship:**\n→ MS in CS or other technical field (easier to sponsor; technical role category)\n\n**I'm budget-constrained:**\n→ MS (cheaper, faster) or part-time MBA (if employer sponsors)\n\n**I'm unsure about my career and want flexibility:**\n→ MBA (opens most doors) or MS in CS (CS skills transfer to any industry now)"
