          "How can I finish describing an image in 25 seconds when there's so much information?",
          "You don't describe EVERY detail. Use the template: Hook (1–2 sec), Main point (5–7 sec), 2–3 key details (8–10 sec), Significance (3–4 sec), Summary (1–2 sec). Focus on the top 2–3 data points; ignore minor details. This fits the time perfectly."
